# notepp namespace manifest (docs/USERSPACE_v2.md UP4).
#
# A code editor: reads its UI from the sealed /system (fonts + libembk.so) and
# reads and writes source under /data. The same two subtrees the simple editor
# needs, and for the same reason -- it cannot name /run or any other root.
#
# It does NOT get to name the compiler or run one. Highlighting C is a matter of
# knowing C's words (baked in at build time from EmbCC's table, see
# tools/mkkeywords.py), not of asking a compiler at runtime, so the editor needs
# no authority it would not otherwise have.
ro /system
rw /data
